{"title": "Asten Lab", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabMain.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The main entrance of Asten Lab.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabMain.jpg/320px-AstenLabMain.jpg?c2db1d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabMain.jpg/480px-AstenLabMain.jpg?c2db1d 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabMain.jpg/640px-AstenLabMain.jpg?c2db1d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabMain.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of Asten Lab.</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Asten Lab</b> is a lab themed interior added in the <b>Obscurity</b> update. It most commonly spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\">Hyx</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Rooms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Rooms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Interior_Features\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Interior Features</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Hazards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Hazards</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Security\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Security</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Containment_Breach\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Containment Breach</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Lockdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Lockdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Event:_Cadaver_Monstrosity\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Event: Cadaver Monstrosity</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Cafeteria</b> - A cafeteria that is always connected to the main entrance hallway, though it can generate up a staircase connected to said hallway. Scrap can spawn here.</li>\n<li><b>Security Office</b> - A security office with several monitors. This office always spawns connected to the main entrance hallway. Scrap typically spawns outside the office doors.</li>\n<li><b>Containment Door</b> - A sealed door that can only be opened by completing a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>. Other random scrap can spawn in the room behind it.</li>\n<li><b>Stairs</b> - Stairs connecting to the upper or lower floor. Can often generate as dead ends.</li>\n<li><b>Janitor Closet</b> - A small janitor's closet with various tools and utilities. Scrap can spawn in these closets.</li>\n<li><b>Lab Section</b> - Larger rooms filled with all sorts of equipment, tables, containers, etc. Scrap can spawn in these rooms.</li>\n<li><b>Storage</b> - Smaller rooms with a random assortment of things. Scrap can spawn in these rooms.</li>\n<li><b>Greenhouse</b> - A corridor with several plants being grown on shelves.</li>\n<li><b>Office Space</b> - A large office space with several desks, wooden walls, and padded floors. Scrap can spawn in this area.</li>\n<li><b>Cube</b> - A room that connects to several hallways and has a cube structure in the middle of it. Scrap can spawn in this room.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Interior_Features\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Interior_Features\">&gt; Interior Features</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Breakable Glass</b> - Players can break open glass containers in some <b>Lab Section</b> rooms by repeatedly interacting with them or by hitting them with a shovel. Scrap can spawn in these containers.</li>\n<li><b>Double Doors</b> - Typically two doors instead of one will connect to the various hallways and rooms in the interior. Either door can be locked, so it's important to make sure they both are before using a key.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Hazards\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Hazards\">&gt; Hazards</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Chemical Bomb</b> - A small, green container that will occassionally beep. If a player gets too close to one, including through obstructions or walls, it will start beeping faster and will explode if players stick by it for too long. This explosion can deal 50 damage to or instantly kill players depending on proximity to the blast. The explosion will also leave behind a slippery green substance around the surrounding area, causing players to slide around.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Secondary_Objectives\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabContainment.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabContainment.jpg/320px-AstenLabContainment.jpg?3692e1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabContainment.jpg/480px-AstenLabContainment.jpg?3692e1 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabContainment.jpg/640px-AstenLabContainment.jpg?3692e1 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabContainment.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Containment Door that holds the reward.</div></div></div><p>One of three unique objectives will randomly generate for players to complete for one of three valuable rewards that will spawn behind the <b>Containment Door</b>.\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Security\">Security</span></h3>\n<p>Players must head to the <b>Security Office</b> and pull the lever located by the desk to turn on the monitors. Players can then interact with the keyboard to open and close doors as well as switch between monitors, with the monitor brightening to indicate which one the player is on. Only one door can be opened at a time and players must open the door matching the number on the <b>Containment Door</b>. Although players can go check what that number is first, it is often faster to brute force it by trying every door in rapid succession.\n</p><p>If the <b>Containment Door</b> is successfully opened, the keyboard can no longer be interacted with and a sound effect will play. Players can then head to and open the <b>Containment Door</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Containment_Breach\">Containment Breach</span></h3>\n<p>Shortly after landing on a moon, five <a href=\"/wiki/Contaminated_Snare_Flea\" title=\"Contaminated Snare Flea\"><b>Contaminated Snare Fleas</b></a> will spawn in the interior. This a variant of the Snare Flea with 1hp and a glowing green liquid on its body. All five must be killed and a sound effect will play every time one is killed. Typically, these fleas are bunched up or close by each other.\n</p><p>If all five are killed, a sound effect will play and players can now open the <b>Containment Door</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lockdown\">Lockdown</span></h3>\n<p>Players must locate a small lab room containing a chemistry station, Hydrogen Peroxide, and a Sulfur Bottle. Players must insert the Sulfur Bottle into the tube above the red canister, insert the Hydrogen Peroxide into the clear container, add oxygen by interacting with the canister to the left on the ground, and turn the nozzle on the red canister to heat up the sulfur. Once complete, <b>Sulfuric Acid</b> will spawn as scrap for players to collect.\n</p><p>Players must then return to the <b>Containment Door</b> and insert the <b>Sulfuric Acid</b> into the panel on the left to fry the circuits. Players can then open the door to claim their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Asten Lab Secondary Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Base Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Solo Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Solo Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIO-JHCF3</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BIO-JHCF3.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"BIO-JHCF3.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/BIO-JHCF3.png/60px-BIO-JHCF3.png?f6f262\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/BIO-JHCF3.png/90px-BIO-JHCF3.png?f6f262 1.5x, /images/thumb/BIO-JHCF3.png/120px-BIO-JHCF3.png?f6f262 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>187\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIO-HNEX5</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BIO-HNEX5.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"BIO-HNEX5.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/BIO-HNEX5.png/60px-BIO-HNEX5.png?cbe9db\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/BIO-HNEX5.png/90px-BIO-HNEX5.png?cbe9db 1.5x, /images/thumb/BIO-HNEX5.png/120px-BIO-HNEX5.png?cbe9db 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>162</td>\n<td>189</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>315\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIO-GZHX4</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BIO-GZHX4.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"BIO-GZHX4.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/BIO-GZHX4.png/60px-BIO-GZHX4.png?1db7bd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/BIO-GZHX4.png/90px-BIO-GZHX4.png?1db7bd 1.5x, /images/thumb/BIO-GZHX4.png/120px-BIO-GZHX4.png?1db7bd 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>252</td>\n<td>294</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>491\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>The reward is randomized, but the chance for a more valuable reward is increased by how early in the day players complete the objective and is influenced by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics#Furniture_luck\">the vanilla luck system</a>. The value of the reward is additionally increased by a difficulty multiplier, ranging from 0.6x to 1.4x, and a solo (singleplayer) multiplier of 1.17x. <b>Security</b> and <b>Lockdown</b> are considered Very Easy difficulty and have a 0.6x multiplier. <b>Containment Breach</b> is considered Easy difficulty and has a multiplier of 1.0x. The base value and multipliers for objective rewards can be adjusted in the Wesleys Interior Tools config under the Secondary Objectives section.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Event:_Cadaver_Monstrosity\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Event:_Cadaver_Monstrosity\">&gt; Event: Cadaver Monstrosity</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg/320px-AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg?a76966\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg/480px-AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg?a76966 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg/640px-AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg?a76966 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabCadaverMonstrosity.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Cadaver Monstrosity.</div></div></div><p>In the <b>Greenhouse</b> tile, there is a chance for a crack in the wall to appear that players can interact with. Interacting with it will cause the player to take 5 damage and cause the <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> to bust through the wall. Two shovels will spawn in front of the <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> and it will trap all players in this room by blocking the exits with its arms.\n</p><p>The <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> will extend a tendril from the center of its body with a groan before striking it down near the center of the room and at a player. Any player hit by the strike will take 25 damage. Players must hit the weak spot at the end of this tendril with a shovel or knife to hurt the <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b>. It takes a total of 10 hits to defeat.\n</p><p>The <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> will attempt to attack players with its mouths, indicated by a mouth chomping and preparing to lunge forward. Coming into contact with a mouth will deal 25 damage to players. The <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> will bite faster and more often as it loses hp.\n</p><p>Additionally, the <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> can spray pollen and acid from the flowers on its body at players. The pollen is harmless, but can obscure vision and make it harder to see visual telegraphs. A flower that is about to spray acid will begin twitching while closed before opening and spraying over the area in front of it, quickly dealing 10 damage per hit.\n</p><p>If players are unsuccessful and die to the <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b>, this room becomes blocked off for the rest of the day. If players are successful and kill the <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b>, it will violently explode and drop a <b>Cadaver Heart</b> worth \u25ae240 to \u25ae351. The <b>Cadaver Monstrosity</b> can kill players post-mortem if it began an animation prior to exploding, such as its acid spray.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabCafeteria.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Cafeteria.\"><img alt=\"The Cafeteria.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabCafeteria.jpg/120px-AstenLabCafeteria.jpg?bc790b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabCafeteria.jpg/180px-AstenLabCafeteria.jpg?bc790b 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabCafeteria.jpg/240px-AstenLabCafeteria.jpg?bc790b 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Cafeteria.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabSecurity.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Security Office.\"><img alt=\"The Security Office.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabSecurity.jpg/120px-AstenLabSecurity.jpg?cac509\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabSecurity.jpg/180px-AstenLabSecurity.jpg?cac509 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabSecurity.jpg/240px-AstenLabSecurity.jpg?cac509 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Security Office.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabStairs.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A staircase.\"><img alt=\"A staircase.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabStairs.jpg/120px-AstenLabStairs.jpg?5ecfaa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabStairs.jpg/180px-AstenLabStairs.jpg?5ecfaa 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabStairs.jpg/240px-AstenLabStairs.jpg?5ecfaa 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A staircase.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabJanitor.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A Janitor Closet.\"><img alt=\"A Janitor Closet.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabJanitor.jpg/120px-AstenLabJanitor.jpg?5cc1ca\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabJanitor.jpg/180px-AstenLabJanitor.jpg?5cc1ca 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabJanitor.jpg/240px-AstenLabJanitor.jpg?5cc1ca 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A Janitor Closet.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabLab1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A lab section with breakable containers.\"><img alt=\"A lab section with breakable containers.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabLab1.jpg/120px-AstenLabLab1.jpg?8b4027\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabLab1.jpg/180px-AstenLabLab1.jpg?8b4027 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabLab1.jpg/240px-AstenLabLab1.jpg?8b4027 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A lab section with breakable containers.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabLab2.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Another lab section.\"><img alt=\"Another lab section.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabLab2.jpg/120px-AstenLabLab2.jpg?16215b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabLab2.jpg/180px-AstenLabLab2.jpg?16215b 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabLab2.jpg/240px-AstenLabLab2.jpg?16215b 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Another lab section.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabStorage1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A storage area.\"><img alt=\"A storage area.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabStorage1.jpg/120px-AstenLabStorage1.jpg?c64c39\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabStorage1.jpg/180px-AstenLabStorage1.jpg?c64c39 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabStorage1.jpg/240px-AstenLabStorage1.jpg?c64c39 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A storage area.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabStorage2.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Another storage area.\"><img alt=\"Another storage area.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabStorage2.jpg/120px-AstenLabStorage2.jpg?17a96d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabStorage2.jpg/180px-AstenLabStorage2.jpg?17a96d 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabStorage2.jpg/240px-AstenLabStorage2.jpg?17a96d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Another storage area.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A freezer and storage area.\"><img alt=\"A freezer and storage area.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg/120px-AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg?e17479\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg/180px-AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg?e17479 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg/240px-AstenLabMetalStorage.jpg?e17479 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A freezer and storage area.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Greenhouse corridor.\"><img alt=\"The Greenhouse corridor.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg/120px-AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg?5b4800\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg/180px-AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg?5b4800 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg/240px-AstenLabGreenhouse.jpg?5b4800 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Greenhouse corridor.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Part of the offices.\"><img alt=\"Part of the offices.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg/120px-AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg?1c0075\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg/180px-AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg?1c0075 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg/240px-AstenLabOfficeSpace.jpg?1c0075 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Part of the offices.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:AstenLabCube.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The room with the large cube structure.\"><img alt=\"The room with the large cube structure.\" src=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabCube.jpg/120px-AstenLabCube.jpg?aec37f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/AstenLabCube.jpg/180px-AstenLabCube.jpg?aec37f 1.5x, /images/thumb/AstenLabCube.jpg/